From c4c96efdb79bca652bf751eaab78f08ff299aa58 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cheung Eric <eric0132@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 07:36:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add recipe section with flavor tags and 97 home-cook
 recipes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Introduce「今日煮咩好」with meal, cook time, ingredient, and multi-select
主味 filters (甜、鹹、鮮、辣、酸、苦、清淡), plus detail sheets for 1–3人份 steps.
